---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const articleTitle = "How to Deploy Gemini CLI, Codex & Open-Source AI Agent Apps to Production";
const articleDescription = "Complete guide for containerizing and deploying applications built with Gemini CLI, Codex, Devstral, and open-source AI coding agents using Nixora.";
const canonicalURL = "https://nixora.co.in/resources/deploy-gemini-codex-open-source-ai-apps/";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": articleTitle,
  "description": articleDescription,
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Nixora",
    "url": "https://nixora.co.in/"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Nixora",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://nixora.co.in/logo-full.jpg"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-09-27",
  "mainEntityOfPage": {
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "@id": canonicalURL
  }
};
---

<Layout title={`${articleTitle} | Nixora`} description={articleDescription} canonicalURL={canonicalURL} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Header />
  <main style="padding-top:100px;padding-bottom:5rem;">
    <article style="max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem;">
      <div style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;text-align:left;">
        <a href="/resources/" style="color:#a78bfa;font-size:0.875rem;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#c4b5fd'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#a78bfa'">
          ← Back to Developer Resources
        </a>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span style="font-family:'Fira Code',monospace;font-size:0.75rem;color:#a78bfa;background:rgba(167,139,250,0.1);padding:0.2rem 0.6rem;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.25);">
            Technical Guide
          </span>
          <span style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#71717a;">Published September 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 1rem;letter-spacing:-0.025em;">
          How to Deploy Gemini CLI, Codex & Open-Source AI Agent Apps to Production
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.7;color:#a1a1aa;margin:0;">
          Step-by-step guide for taking applications generated by Gemini CLI, OpenAI Codex, Devstral, and custom AI agents from local code to live cloud deployments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #1f1f1f;margin:2rem 0;" />

      <div class="article-content" style="color:#e4e4e7;font-size:1.025rem;line-height:1.8;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.75rem;">
        <p>
          AI coding agents like Gemini CLI, Codex, Devstral, and Llama Coder can generate fully functional web applications in minutes. However, moving code from your local development environment to a live HTTPS URL presents operational hurdles: container building, port binding, TLS certificate issuance, and cloud infrastructure setup.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:1rem 0 0.25rem;">The AI Agent Deployment Gap</h2>
        <p>
          Most AI coding agents generate application code designed to run locally on <code style="color:#a78bfa;background:#0d0d0d;padding:0.2rem 0.4rem;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.875rem;">localhost</code>. When deploying to production environments, several common issues arise:
        </p>

        <ul style="padding-left:1.25rem;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;color:#a1a1aa;">
          <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Hardcoded Localhost Bindings:</strong> AI agents default to binding services to <code style="color:#a78bfa;">127.0.0.1</code> instead of <code style="color:#a78bfa;">0.0.0.0</code> required for container routing.</li>
          <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Missing Container Configurations:</strong> Generated output rarely includes production-ready Dockerfiles, port mappings, or health checks.</li>
          <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Unconfigured Environment Variables:</strong> Database connection strings, API keys, and secret keys require secure cloud provisioning.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:1rem 0 0.25rem;">Deploying with Nixora CLI in 3 Steps</h2>

        <p>
          Nixora automates the operational transition from AI code output to a live running application with zero manual infrastructure configuration.
        </p>

        <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;color:#a78bfa;margin:0.5rem 0 0.1rem;">Step 1: Install & Initialize</h3>
        <p>
          Install the Nixora CLI and initialize your project root:
        </p>
        <pre style="background:#0a0a0a;border:1px solid #1f1f1f;border-radius:8px;padding:1.25rem;font-family:'Fira Code',monospace;font-size:0.875rem;color:#e4e4e7;overflow-x:auto;">pip install nixora
nixora init</pre>

        <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;color:#a78bfa;margin:0.5rem 0 0.1rem;">Step 2: Deploy Your App</h3>
        <p>
          Run <code style="color:#a78bfa;">nixora deploy</code> in your working directory. Nixora detects the runtime (Node.js, Python FastAPI/Flask, Go), containerizes the code automatically, provisions compute, and attaches a secure HTTPS TLS certificate:
        </p>
        <pre style="background:#0a0a0a;border:1px solid #1f1f1f;border-radius:8px;padding:1.25rem;font-family:'Fira Code',monospace;font-size:0.875rem;color:#e4e4e7;overflow-x:auto;">$ nixora deploy
└─ scanning project root
└─ detecting runtime: python@3.11 (FastAPI)
└─ entry point: main.py
└─ dependencies: 18 packages
building container...
✔ Container image pushed
✔ Compute provisioned (us-east)
✔ HTTPS certificate issued

LIVE URL: https://my-app.nixora.co.in</pre>

        <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;color:#a78bfa;margin:0.5rem 0 0.1rem;">Step 3: Diagnose & Monitor</h3>
        <p>
          If your AI agent generated code with missing packages or incorrect port settings, run <code style="color:#a78bfa;">nixora diagnose</code> to get automated error root cause diagnosis and direct resolution steps.
        </p>

        <div style="background:rgba(167,139,250,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.25);border-radius:10px;padding:1.5rem;margin-top:1.5rem;text-align:center;">
          <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 0.5rem;">Ready to ship AI-generated apps to production?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:#a1a1aa;margin:0 0 1.25rem;">
            Join approved builders testing Nixora CLI for automated AI deployment.
          </p>
          <a href="/#early-access" class="shiny-cta">Join the waitlist →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
